translate japan d5_ending_home_violence_1423aae3:



    voice "voice/karina/5day/163 Dur.ogg"
    Mam "めちゃくちゃね。せめて自分の指を切り落とさなくてよかったわ。"


translate japan d5_ending_home_violence_3bf752e3:



